{
  "pin": "6593a06",
  "head": "b05c727d0b6cd5a84eb2e844cb2104aada436df7",
  "head_subject": "chore(a3-reverdict): land Change 2 archive + review verification scripts",
  "supersedes_note": "The first baseline.json asserted 'the integrator fix is NOT committed; HEAD (188b9fb) still carries the PRE-fix _betainc_regularized'. Measured false on three counts: (1) HEAD was f6461d7, not 188b9fb, at the time of that measurement; (2) sphere.py at HEAD carries the full quadrature fix; (3) the three specs are in HEAD, not worktree-carried. Only gating.py was uncommitted. This field is a record of a past measurement and does NOT assert anything about the current HEAD -- read `head` / `head_subject` for that. The prose used to name f6461d7 as if it were still HEAD, which it stopped being once a parallel session committed on top of it; a snapshot is not a fact about the present.",
  "anchor_expectation_as_of": "1afac58 (wayfinder 37), pre-1afac58 for the other two",
  "pin_to_head_commits": [
    "b05c727 chore(a3-reverdict): land Change 2 archive + review verification scripts",
    "a97e3a7 fix(a3): clone-then-perturb resurrection, require per-expert mask, window UR",
    "ccc21ab fix(a3): align five low-risk code paths to the contracts C1/C2 pinned",
    "557a54e fix(skeleton): make Phase 0 and mask obligations normative; pin the __all__ de-dup rule",
    "1afac58 fix(wayfinder): narrow Req 23 to Phase 1-4; make territory_collapse and req-15 Layer 2 explicit deferrals",
    "c08d50f feat(a3-reverdict): adjudicate the A-3 bucket at HEAD; fix the checker's T3 invariant",
    "8ba7d6f docs(a2-round2): record that f6461d7 is a two-author commit",
    "f6461d7 fix(a2-errata): correct the A-2 spec defects, then repair the math that correction broke",
    "188b9fb fix(f1-followup): close the second copy of the 50-digit mpmath mislabel",
    "4f3e752 chore(opsx): archive F1-F8 fixes; repair anchors swallowed by archive",
    "969b17c fix(f4,f5,f6,f7): pin loss closed-form wiring; make guards actually fail",
    "5a7e48d fix(f1,f2,f3,f8): restore numeric-guard fidelity + kill residual line-drift",
    "315065e chore(opsx): archive B13/B14/B15 changes; restore B15 reverted by e50cc02",
    "2dc340d docs(archive): record 9.5 resolution of the 9.4 BLOCKED item",
    "c0ec330 chore(opsx): archive b10-b11-b12 and voronoi-angle review findings",
    "e50cc02 chore(inflight): checkpoint parallel session's in-flight work",
    "e8771b9 docs(change): record second-round archive blocker for fix-config-docstring-beta-line-drift"
  ],
